
# Minimum Size Subarray Sum
'''All numbers are positive, expanding the window increases the sum, shrinking it decreases the sum'''
'''complexity:- O(n) time, O(1) space'''

'''
Add numbers using right until the sum reaches the target.

Remove numbers from the left using left to find a shorter subarray.

Save the smallest length found.'''

target = 7
nums = [2, 3, 1, 2, 4, 3]

left = 0
total = 0
min_len = len(nums) + 1

for right in range(len(nums)):
    total += nums[right]

    while total >= target:
        length = right - left + 1

        if length < min_len:
            min_len = length

        total -= nums[left]
        left += 1

